            "body": "there is https://github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig/blob/master/lsp/azure_pipelines_ls.lua so i wonder if naming this `azure_ms_terraform_lsp` would make sense, to help discoverability\r\n\r\nthe CLI name doesn't matter too much, they often change anyway...",
